            },
            "formats": [
              "heading"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 3. L'exemple classique du lycée : Le Procédé Mond (pour le Nickel)",
            "start": 2241,
            "end": 2311
          },
          {
            "id": "p26",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "C’est l'exemple historique parfait découvert à la fin du XIXᵉ siècle pour purifier le **Nickel (Ni)** :",
            "start": 2313,
            "end": 2416
          },
          {
            "id": "p27",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "heading",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. **La capture (à ~50 °C) :**",
            "start": 2418,
            "end": 2448
          },
          {
            "id": "p28",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   On fait passer du monoxyde de carbone ($CO$, un gaz) sur du nickel impur. ",
            "start": 2449,
            "end": 2526
          },
          {
            "id": "p29",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$\\text{Ni (solide, impur)} + 4\\text{CO (gaz)} \\xrightarrow{50^\\circ\\text{C}} \\text{Ni(CO)}_4 \\text{ (gaz)}$$",
            "start": 2527,
            "end": 2639
          },
          {
            "id": "p30",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   Le produit formé s'appelle le *tétracarbonyle de nickel*. C'est un gaz ! Les impuretés restent solides dans le four.",
            "start": 2640,
            "end": 2759
          },
          {
            "id": "p31",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "heading",
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. **La libération (à ~230 °C) :**",
            "start": 2761,
            "end": 2795
          },
          {
            "id": "p32",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   On envoie ce gaz dans une autre cuve beaucoup plus chaude. La molécule éclate :",
            "start": 2796,
            "end": 2878
          },
          {
            "id": "p33",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   $$\\text{Ni(CO)}_4 \\text{ (gaz)} \\xrightarrow{230^\\circ\\text{C}} \\text{Ni (solide, PUR à 99,99 %)} + 4\\text{CO (gaz)}$$",
            "start": 2879,
            "end": 3000
          },
          {
            "id": "p34",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   Le nickel pur se dépose sous forme de petites billes métalliques, et le gaz $CO$ est renvoyé au début pour recommencer le cycle.",
            "start": 3001,
            "end": 3132
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The reaction equations, temperatures (~50 °C for tetracarbonylnickel formation, ~230 °C for decomposition), and physical states are factually correct.",
          "errors": []
        }
      },
